{0x63649F0B, "Need for Speed\x81 Most Wanted memakai fitur simpan otomatis. Informasi game disimpan otomatis selama bermain di memory\xA0" "card\xA0(PS2) di slot\xA0MEMORY\xA0" "CARD\xA0" "1 saat ikon simpan otomatis tampil."},
